    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在低于转折频率 10 倍以上的频段内，复合相角和幅值均不受 2 类环节的影响，因为此时幅值为 1 (0 dB) 且相角小于 5°。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Both composite phase and magnitude are unaffected by a class 2 term at frequencies below the break point by more than a factor of 10, because magnitude is 1 (0 dB) and phase is less than 5°.",
